# CHG-2060 (approved): PingAccess, in front of the Tech Pubs application, in both environments. The source runs
# PingAccess 8.3.6 on an admin node and two engines; the target runs 9.1.1 on Azure VMs (an upgrade within the
# adapter's range, which the planner names). Tech Pubs is published at techpubs.example-aero.test in the source
# (a service name the target doesn't bind yet); the application behind PingAccess is another team's system, reached
# as an external host in each environment; the web session's client secret has a secret reference in both. Stage, an
# overlay of the source's production, runs no PingAccess: it drops the new roles.

